{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1416931-lunars-for-sale-october-7th","id":1416931,"title":"Lunars for Sale October 7th","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-05T19:28:06-07:00","id":1416931,"title":"Lunars for Sale October 7th","content":"From the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/and-ahunting-we-will-go-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting Notes</a>, the Lunar's book goes on sale on Wednesday, October 7th.<br /> <br /> So if you weren't already part of the Kickstarter, you'll be able to order your Lunar's book in a few days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T00:01:36-07:00","id":1416952,"title":"","content":"And if you were in the Kickstarter, you\u2019ve already received the final copy on DT RPG.<br /> <br /> Everspace on the Exalted Discord was kind enough to compile the changes which I faithfully copy here:<br /> <br /> **===== Rough Changelog for Release Version =====**<br /> <br /> Various language updates (like Totemic -&gt; Archetype)<br /> <br /> Glossery:<br /> - Added Lunar Dominion entry to describe what they are.<br /> - Moonsilver Tattoos: now specifies &quot;unwanted&quot; magical transformation<br /> - Moonsilver Artifacts: reshape to accommodate their shapeshifted form __if they wish__<br /> <br /> (charms below)<br /> Charms:<br /> (-&gt; = Renamed to)<br /> <br /> - **Totem Beast Embodiment** -&gt; **Sacred Beast Embodiment**<br /> - **Finding the Needle's Eye**: Protean now rerolls an additional 1 instead of ignoring another point of defense. (This is probably a nerf if you are in a protean form)<br /> - **Flesh Sculpting Art** : Clarify that it's reroll 1s until they fail to appear.<br /> - **Silver General Foresight**: Clarify that it's reroll 1s until they fail to appear.<br /> - **Many-Voiced Mockingbrid**: Clarify that it's reroll 1s until they fail to appear.<br /> - **Brother-or-Duty Dilemma**: Instead of &quot;lower&quot; it is &quot;equal or lesser&quot; intimacy (better)<br /> - **Echo-Drinking Awareness**: Protean changed to a noncharm success from db9s. (typically better since db9 is &quot;better sense&quot; for animals typically)<br /> - **Mountainous Spirit Expression**: adds +3 to all raw withering damage rather than just natural attacks<br /> - **Deadly Claw Blow**: Removed the following:<br /> ```<br /> She always uses her unmodiied Strength to <br /> attack, and doesn\u2019t add dice from bonus Strength dots <br /> or double non-10 successes on attack rolls.<br /> ```<br /> Allowing dice from bonus strength dots to apply. This has little effect on Lunars as written, but if you have ported this charm elsewhere like me, you should review. (better)<br /> <br /> - **Kraken-Arm Lash**: changed from the specific &quot;Ininite Grasp&quot; to the more general &quot;tentacles&quot;. (better)<br /> - **Foe-Defying Frenzy**: No longer resets inititative with the repurchase. (better)<br /> - **Shadow-Mind Meditation**: Rewording so that it is not &quot;hollywood-multiple-personality disorder&quot; charm. <br /> - **Lodestone Reckoning Manner**: You can now use sail! Wow! (better)<br /> - **The Spider's Trapdoor**: Repurchase changes the gambit to difficulty 6 to combine it with an effect, instead of rasing the difficulty by 1. (worse)<br /> <br /> Martial Arts:<br /> Centipede Style:<br /> - **Blurring Scurry Prana** -&gt; **Blurring Scurry Technique**<br /> <br /> Falcon Style:<br /> - **Doom Plummets Down**: mastery effect specifies &quot;she may reflexively rush the struck enemy __from close range__&quot;<br /> <br /> Swaying Grass:<br /> - **Jubilant Battle Proposition**: __No longer changes join battle__, instead adds (Performance) to join battle, and (Performance) to the inspire if stunted.<br /> - **Whirling Rhythm Revolution**: Removed the ability to gain the effects from a rush.<br /> - **Inescapable Tumbleweed Prana** -&gt; **Inescapable Tumbleweed Pursuit*<br /> <br /> Artifacts:<br /> Night\u2019s Sweet Whisper:<br /> - **Moonlit Serenity Paean**: Works with Heard-Reinforcement Stance instead of Taboo-Enforcing Beast<br /> <br /> Animals:<br /> - **Moose**: from 2 parry to 4 parry. Now no longer has a speed bonus of +0. They are now impossible to ride I'm sorry you had to find out like this (/s).<br /> <br /> Backers:<br /> - Beauteous Jewels of Ending Wrath's wrath is now Unending (better)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 10-06-2020, 03:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value"